    "UIName": "Savage Coyote 'Koga'",
    "Id": "mechdef_savage_coyote_SVG-K",
    "Name": "Savage Coyote K",
    "Details": "The personal 'Mech of Khan Sullivan Koga, it mimics her trends in leading the Coyotes; a strong base, upgraded and enhanced by new features.  Building off of the classic Awesome loadout, three ER PPCs provide long range firepower without ammo constraints, or thanks to the 23 double heatsinks, heat worries. Running relatively minimal ammo considering the heat produced by the ER PPCs, the UAC/10 and ATM 9 are more support weapons; available to finish off a target, instead of waiting for the PPCs to recharge. Khan Koga used this to great effect when attacking the Nova Cats on Huntress, splitting fire between a distant target with two PPCs, and finishing off a closer 'Mech with the UAC/10 and ATM 9.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Rugged</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.18</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_savagecoyote_v1"
  },
